{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p>9月3日位于上海虹桥机场2号航站楼3楼出发大厅的<strong>京东快递品牌店</strong>开业</p>\n<figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/44045/8/13947/144965/5d706484Edff4b278/ce18abcad58a3f92.jpg\" /></figure>\n<p>这是京东快递首家机场品牌店为机场及周边用户提供<strong>寄件、收件</strong>服务</p>\n<figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/60199/13/9308/146623/5d706496E12329d8e/d6829cf1901a0a23.jpg\" /></figure>\n<p>登机前安检时发现有物品不能携带、托运</p>\n<p>行李物品太重不想带走</p>\n<p>把物品提前寄到机场，坐飞机时顺便带走&hellip;&hellip;</p>\n<p>这些场景都可以用到京东快递</p>\n<figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/48518/5/9794/191756/5d7064a6E1fc6994c/84a112fbe6e7ab5e.jpg\" /></figure>\n<p>未来京东快递还将在多个机场开设品牌店</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/103872/27/32157/43354/63f6c7bcF8d879f6c/5abf27b77eab7fe3.png\" /></a></p>", "contentCode": "content00206", "contentTitle": "京东快递首家机场品牌店落户上海虹桥国际机场", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1567646901000, "id": 323, "isDelete": 0, "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/80490/37/9344/144965/5d7064afEd1f54e91/10039c54bb888978.jpg", "updateTime": 1677117377000}}